4	//! Live forkd integration tests. NOT `#[ignore]`'d: they compile on every PR (so
5	//! they cannot bit-rot) and skip LOUDLY when no controller is configured. Run on
6	//! an x86_64 KVM host with `FORKD_URL`/`FORKD_TOKEN`/`FORKD_SNAPSHOT` set (see
